  "details": "I keep freezing randomly no matter what world I’m in or how many people are there, for just a moment or up to 30+ seconds at times. It’s random and sometimes really bad and sometimes barley noticeable. Eventually it will give me an error message reading “cannot connect to vr chat servers” or “vr chat had an internal error” then log me out and back in. This only started happening after the new update and I’ve cleared my cache, reinstalled steam vr and vr chat multiple times, checked my firewall, updated my PC, changed out my link cable, and nothing has worked. I even double check my Internet speed and reset the router just to be safe. Any ideas, or is it out of my hands and in Vrchats?",
